Bots is a Rust port of Threebot (https://github.com/RokaSwK/threebot, MIT): the gateway's
behaviour, on-disk formats (bot.json, vault.enc, projects.json) and Bot instructions follow it.

It runs on T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code) and talks to it over the same protocol.
The app is written in Contract and built with Exact (https://github.com/expo/exact, MIT, Expo).
Akeru Bot (https://github.com/opencoredev/akeru-bot) was read for context only; no code is used.

Bots is an independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by T3 Tools Inc., Expo or the
Threebot authors.
